<p class="govuk-body">You need to wear this tag all of the time.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">You will be told if and how you will need to charge the tag battery when your tag is installed. You will need to follow those instructions.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">Do not tamper with your tag and tell <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_tag_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a> if it stops working.</p>
